mobs.description:
Area Keying Spoiler
{{spoiler|Used for the keying quest of [[Glinting Hollow]]<br>
Turn in [[Fresh Squirrel Meat]] (Even while KOS, agroing wolves around him causes him to agro)<br>
This causes Treants and Wolves in the area to drop [[Glinting Scale of Nature]] which acts as a key to the next area. Side note, if you kill Softpaw then the event dies and the keys won't drop.<br>
Proceeding down the cave that Softpaws appears in while holding [[Glinting Scale of Nature]] will cause you to move to the next area.
}}
